        "start_line"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
    "name": "read_file_range"
  },
  {
    "description": "web_search\n\nSearch the web for current information.\n\nUse this when the workspace does not contain the answer and you need external\ndocumentation, API specs, or current facts. Prefer reading local files and\nsearching the workspace first. With native/exa modes, Umans executes server-side\nsearch; with none, a local DuckDuckGo fallback is used. Capped at 10 results by default.",
    "input_schema": {
